+| Authentication, security and secret handling | Accepted Phase 7B auth integration covers expiry/revocation, rotation, privilege, CSRF and redacted logs; Phase 9 physical Android covers direct TLS/cookies, expiry, offline privacy and sync conflict; P10-01 covers artifact names/types/private-value scan. | Real packaged HTTP denied pre-login and post-logout reads, logged in, required CSRF for Settings write, returned no-store on private responses, rejected three static-root probes, and found no TEST password/DSN/session/CSRF value in public bytes or logs. | None for these bounded local checks. This is not a comprehensive security or dependency audit. |
